{"sections":[{"id":"noi-dung","title":"Nội dung hướng dẫn","paragraphs":[],"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192466","runs":[{"text":"Madness is calling to you...  will you answer? ","italic":true},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192514","runs":[{"text":"Diễn ra trước các sự kiện của Voice in the Sea\n","italic":true}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192562","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part I - Summit of Insanity:","bold":true},{"text":" Fa is a mysterious woman who can help you stay alive if you do her a few favors. Be careful, as nothing is what it seems and the more appealing something is, the faster you should kill it. ("},{"text":"/join garden","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/darkon-s-garden"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-192798","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part II - ","bold":true},{"text":"Elegy of Madness","bold":true},{"text":":","bold":true},{"text":" Re is a mystery and impish girl who will help investigate the deaths of a town frozen in time under a blood-red moon. Good luck and see you on the other side ("},{"text":"/join eridani","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/eridani"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-193003","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part III - Necessary Sacrifices:","bold":true},{"text":" Eridani's disease has spread to Astravia, the King faces an uprising, and mysterious members of the Scale are wreaking havoc ("},{"text":"/join astravia","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/astravia"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-193181","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IV - Cataclysmic Catalyst:","bold":true},{"text":" Battle an invasion of nightmarish creatures and fight to learn about the profane practices of the tyrant king ("},{"text":"/join astraviacastle","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/astravia-castle"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-193349","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part V - Song of Judgement:","bold":true},{"text":" Screams of madness, cries of pain, sing out judgement's sweet refrain. Darkon has successfully summoned the Primordial Judgement ("},{"text":"/join astraviajudge","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/astravia-judgement"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-193531","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VI - Spring Overture:","bold":true},{"text":" Before you can help bring the tragedy of Astravia to an end, you must understand how Darkon's journey began ("},{"text":"/join eridanipast","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/eridani-past"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-193689","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VII - Summer Soprano:","bold":true},{"text":" Madness runs in the blood. Royalty is bound to their blood. LOYALTY is paid for by your blood. Coincidences? I think not ("},{"text":"/join astraviapast","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/astravia-past"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-193861","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part VIII - Operatic Fall:","bold":true},{"text":" Discover secrets that transcend the boundaries of space & time as the full truth of Astravia's origins are revealed ("},{"text":"/join firstobservatory","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/first-observatory"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194032","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part IX - Verisimo in Winter:","bold":true},{"text":" Defiance. Salvation. Justice. All these and more will be yours… Betrayal will not go unpunished ("},{"text":"/join genesisgarden","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/genesis-garden"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194183","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Part X - Finale:","bold":true},{"text":" A sacrifice has been demanded and the time for justice is at hand. Lore is on the brink of being erased and replaced with a more perfect reality. The fate of the world... and the prince... is in your hands ("},{"text":"/join theworld","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/the-world"},{"text":").\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194426","runs":[{"text":"→ "},{"text":"Full Darkon's Elegy of Madness từ Wiki","href":"http://aqwwiki.wikidot.com/story:darkon-s-elegy-of-madness"},{"text":"\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"p-194468","runs":[{"text":"Video "},{"text":"FULL Walkthrough","bold":true,"italic":true},{"text":": "},{"text":"Part I","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oKSpoPwxOhk"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part II","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fGREL8tbpdg"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part III","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MhDaS44pia4"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part IV","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hj5aDxSs7os"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part V","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xQWB6uqqnYo"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part VI","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a21sxT0pmBU"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part VII","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KLmEMB2HUzQ"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part VIII","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jKpbRIo0ifw"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part IX","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_kqniPivfFY"},{"text":" - "},{"text":"Part X","href":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g1CGpOybV5s"},{"text":"\n"}]}]}],"previous":{"title":"Age of Ruin Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/age-of-ruin-saga"},"next":{"title":"Yokai Dragons Saga","url":"/cot-truyen/yokai-dragons-saga"},"missingImageCount":2}